DMapS patches (1)-(4) used for the DMapS comparison in the online appendix
(table D.III: rows marked with a dagger only run with patches (3) and (4)).

Base:   https://github.com/RoccoLoter/DMapS at commit b0b5dde
Apply:  git apply /path/to/dsabre/code/patches/dmaps.patch   (inside the DMapS checkout)

(1) src/router/multi_mode_routing.py: make the bundled pytket-dqc baseline
    import optional; its pytket-qiskit ABI conflicts with DMapS's qiskit pin.
(2) src/router/multi_mode_routing.py: size the output register from the
    device's qubit names instead of the hard-coded 66 qubits.
(3) src/router/multi_mode_routing.py: map every qubit by its global circuit
    index, so multi-register circuits (ae, qpeexact) no longer collide.
(4) src/partitioner/qucirc_partitioner.py: give qubits that carry only
    single-qubit gates a partition vertex (weight 1) and skip device padding
    qubits, fixing the KeyError on bv.

